<title>FRANCE: French GDP rose revised 1.5 pct in 1996 - INSEE.</title>
<headline>French GDP rose revised 1.5 pct in 1996 - INSEE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office INSEE gave the following gross domestic product data (base 1980, changes from previous quarters in percent except stocks variation, in billions of 1980 francs.)</p>
<p>					 Q4	  Q3	1996</p>
<p> Total GDP			   0.2	0.8	 1.5</p>
<p> Imports			     1.2	2.6	 2.5</p>
<p> Exports			     1.3	3.6	 4.7</p>
<p> Household consumption	  -0.5	0.6	 2.1</p>
<p> Investment			  0.4	1.4	-0.5</p>
<p> Stocks variation		  1.0     -1.9	-7.3</p>
<p>INSEE gave the following more detailed breakdown:</p>
<p>				Q4 96  Q3 96  Q2 96  Q1 96  Q4 95   1996</p>
<p> Total GDP		   0.2    0.8    -0.2   1.3   -0.3     1.5</p>
<p> Imports		     1.2    2.6    -0.3   2.1   -1.8     2.5</p>
<p> Exports		     1.3    3.6    -1.3   4.7   -0.4     4.7</p>
<p> Household consumption  -0.5    0.6    -1.0   2.4   -0.2     2.1</p>
<p> Public consumption	0.4    0.4     0.3   0.4    0.4     1.3</p>
<p> Investment		  0.4    1.4    -1.4  -0.7   -0.3    -0.5</p>
<p> Stocks variation	  1.0   -1.9     0.8  -7.3    0.5    -7.3</p>
</text>
